OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolice examine video of anti-migrant
OL,4,Aactivist slashing dinghy with knife
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniel Thomas, known to his supporters
OL,7,Fas Danny Tommo, had been filming the
OL,8,Ftransfer from a yellow speedboat while
OL,9,Fgiving commentary to a live stream
OL,10,Faudience of more than 15,000 people.
OL,12,FThe video then shows him sailing up to
OL,13,Fthe boat, taking out a small knife and
OL,14,Fstart slashing at the side of the
OL,15,Fmigrant boat.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
