OL,3,ATwo pilots eject and parachute out of
OL,4,ARAF plane before crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo RAF pilots ejected and parachuted
OL,7,Fout of their plane before the training
OL,8,Faircraft crashed.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots of
OL,11,Fthe RAF T2 Hawk aircraft were being
OL,12,Ftreated for minor injuries following
OL,13,Fthe incident in the Pencarnisiog area
OL,14,Fof Anglesey.
OL,16,FThe force said helicopters from the
OL,17,FCoastguard and the Wales Air Ambulance
OL,18,Fwere at the scene close to RAF Valley
OL,19,Fon the island. The pilots have been
OL,20,Ftaken to Birmingham for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
